-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1404 | 3. The European Data Protection Supervisor may also establish an AI regulatory sandbox for Union institutions, bodies, offices and agencies, and may exercise the roles and the tasks of national competent authorities in accordance with this Chapter.
@ref Art 57(3) as enacted (the roles and tasks of national competent authorities) (src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1404)
GIVEN `the sandbox is the one the European Data Protection Supervisor established under paragraph 3` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Art 57(3) as enacted the body whose roles and tasks the European Data Protection Supervisor exercises in the sandbox` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the sandbox is the one the European Data Protection Supervisor established under paragraph 3` THEN JUST "the European Data Protection Supervisor, in the roles and tasks of the national competent authorities"  -- the reading rule: "may exercise the roles and the tasks of national competent authorities in accordance with this Chapter"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the roles and tasks pass to the European Data Protection Supervisor only in its own sandbox

