    ELSE CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN `Art 57(3) as enacted the body whose roles and tasks the European Data Protection Supervisor exercises in the sandbox` `the sandbox is the one the European Data Protection Supervisor established under paragraph 3`  -- VERSION as enacted
         WHEN `as amended` THEN `Art 57(3) as amended the body that a reference to national competent authorities in Chapter VI is read as` `the sandbox is the one the European Data Protection Supervisor established under paragraph 3`  -- VERSION as amended

-- src:855 | 3a. The AI Office may establish an AI regulatory sandbox at Union level for AI systems covered by Article 75(1). For this purpose, references to national competent authorities in this Chapter shall be construed, where relevant, as references to the AI Office. That AI regulatory sandbox shall be implemented in close cooperation with relevant competent authorities, in particular where compliance with Union legislation other than this Regulation is supervised in the AI regulatory sandbox, and shall provide priority access to SMEs, including start-ups, and SMCs.
