        IF `the sandbox is for AI systems covered by Article 75(1)` THEN JUST TRUE  -- the grant: "The AI Office may establish an AI regulatory sandbox at Union level for AI systems covered by Article 75(1)"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "for AI systems covered by Article 75(1)"

