§ `Article 57(9): the objectives of AI regulatory sandboxes (the list, as enacted and as amended)`

-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1411 | 9. The establishment of AI regulatory sandboxes shall aim to contribute to the following objectives:
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1412 | (a)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1413 | improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law;
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1414 | (b)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1415 | supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox;
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1416 | (c)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1417 | fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem;
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1418 | (d)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1419 | contributing to evidence-based regulatory learning;
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1420 | (e)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1421 | facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups.
@ref Art 57(9) as enacted (the objectives) (src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1411-1421)
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`Art 57(9) as enacted the objectives of AI regulatory sandboxes` MEANS
    LIST
        "improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law"
      , "supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox"
      , "fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem"
      , "contributing to evidence-based regulatory learning"
      , "facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups"

-- src:866 | 9. The establishment of AI regulatory sandboxes shall aim to contribute to the following objectives:
-- src:867 | (a) improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law;
-- src:868 | (b) supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox;
-- src:869 | (c) fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem;
-- src:870 | (d) contributing to evidence-based regulatory learning;
-- src:871 | ▼M1 REPLACED
-- src:872 | (e) facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups, and SMCs.
@ref Art 57(9) as amended (the objectives) (src:866-872)
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`Art 57(9) as amended the objectives of AI regulatory sandboxes` MEANS
    LIST
        "improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law"
      , "supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox"
      , "fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem"
      , "contributing to evidence-based regulatory learning"
      , "facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups, and SMCs"

@ref Art 57(9) (the objective is one of the objectives: gate, then the version in force; src:866-872)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the objective` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 57(9) the objective is one of the objectives of AI regulatory sandboxes` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 57 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter VI and Chapter VIII (group General) apply from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN IF elem `the objective` `Art 57(9) as enacted the objectives of AI regulatory sandboxes` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING  -- VERSION as enacted. NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "the following objectives" names objectives to contribute to and does not say that others are excluded
         WHEN `as amended` THEN IF elem `the objective` `Art 57(9) as amended the objectives of AI regulatory sandboxes` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING  -- VERSION as amended. NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "the following objectives" names objectives to contribute to and does not say that others are excluded

-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1411 | 9. The establishment of AI regulatory sandboxes shall aim to contribute to the following objectives:
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1412 | (a)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1413 | improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law;
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1414 | (b)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1415 | supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox;
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1416 | (c)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1417 | fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem;
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1418 | (d)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1419 | contributing to evidence-based regulatory learning;
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1420 | (e)
-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1421 | facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups.
@ref Art 57(9) as enacted (the aim) (src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1411-1421)
GIVEN `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to evidence-based regulatory learning` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 57(9) as enacted the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to the objectives` MEANS
    BRANCH
        OTHERWISE JUST (`the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law` AND `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox` AND `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem` AND `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to evidence-based regulatory learning` AND `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The establishment of AI regulatory sandboxes shall aim to contribute to the following objectives"

-- src:866 | 9. The establishment of AI regulatory sandboxes shall aim to contribute to the following objectives:
-- src:867 | (a) improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law;
-- src:868 | (b) supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox;
