-- src:871 | ▼M1 REPLACED
-- src:872 | (e) facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups, and SMCs.
@ref Art 57(9) as amended (the aim) (src:866-872)
GIVEN `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to evidence-based regulatory learning` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups, and SMCs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 57(9) as amended the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to the objectives` MEANS
    BRANCH
        OTHERWISE JUST (`the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to improving legal certainty to achieve regulatory compliance with this Regulation or, where relevant, other applicable Union and national law` AND `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to supporting the sharing of best practices through cooperation with the authorities involved in the AI regulatory sandbox` AND `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to fostering innovation and competitiveness and facilitating the development of an AI ecosystem` AND `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to evidence-based regulatory learning` AND `the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to facilitating and accelerating access to the Union market for AI systems, in particular when provided by SMEs, including start-ups, and SMCs`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The establishment of AI regulatory sandboxes shall aim to contribute to the following objectives"

@ref Art 57(9) (the aim) (dispatcher: gate, then the version in force; src:866-872)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the aim covers (a) improving legal certainty` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the aim covers (b) the sharing of best practices` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the aim covers (c) innovation and competitiveness` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the aim covers (d) evidence-based regulatory learning` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the aim covers (e) access to the Union market` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 57(9) the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to the objectives` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 57 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter VI and Chapter VIII (group General) apply from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE CONSIDER `Omnibus Art 4 the version in force` `the date asked`
         WHEN `as enacted` THEN `Art 57(9) as enacted the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to the objectives` `the aim covers (a) improving legal certainty` `the aim covers (b) the sharing of best practices` `the aim covers (c) innovation and competitiveness` `the aim covers (d) evidence-based regulatory learning` `the aim covers (e) access to the Union market`  -- VERSION as enacted
         WHEN `as amended` THEN `Art 57(9) as amended the establishment of sandboxes aims to contribute to the objectives` `the aim covers (a) improving legal certainty` `the aim covers (b) the sharing of best practices` `the aim covers (c) innovation and competitiveness` `the aim covers (d) evidence-based regulatory learning` `the aim covers (e) access to the Union market`  -- VERSION as amended

-- src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1422 | 10. National competent authorities shall ensure that, to the extent the innovative AI systems involve the processing of personal data or otherwise fall under the supervisory remit of other national authorities or competent authorities providing or supporting access to data, the national data protection authorities and those other national or competent authorities are associated with the operation of the AI regulatory sandbox and involved in the supervision of those aspects to the extent of their respective tasks and powers.
@ref Art 57(10) as enacted (src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:1422)
GIVEN `the innovative AI systems involve the processing of personal data` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the innovative AI systems otherwise fall under the supervisory remit of other national authorities or competent authorities providing or supporting access to data` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the national data protection authorities and those other national or competent authorities are associated with the operation of the AI regulatory sandbox` IS A BOOLEAN
      `they are involved in the supervision of those aspects to the extent of their respective tasks and powers` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 57(10) as enacted the national competent authorities have associated the other authorities with the sandbox` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the innovative AI systems involve the processing of personal data` OR `the innovative AI systems otherwise fall under the supervisory remit of other national authorities or competent authorities providing or supporting access to data`) THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to the extent the innovative AI systems involve the processing of personal data or otherwise fall under the supervisory remit of other national authorities or competent authorities providing or supporting access to data"
        OTHERWISE JUST (`the national data protection authorities and those other national or competent authorities are associated with the operation of the AI regulatory sandbox` AND `they are involved in the supervision of those aspects to the extent of their respective tasks and powers`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "National competent authorities shall ensure that ... the national data protection authorities and those other national or competent authorities are associated with the operation of the AI regulatory sandbox and involved in the supervision of those aspects"

