        OTHERWISE JUST (`the competent data protection authorities and those other national or competent authorities are associated with the operation of the AI regulatory sandbox` AND `they are involved in the supervision of those aspects to the extent of their respective tasks and powers`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "National competent authorities shall ensure that ... the competent data protection authorities and those other national or competent authorities are associated with the operation of the AI regulatory sandbox and involved in the supervision of those aspects"

