        OTHERWISE JUST (`other competent authorities responsible for other Union and national law were actively involved in the supervision of the AI system in the sandbox` AND `those authorities provided guidance for compliance`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where other competent authorities responsible for other Union and national law were actively involved in the supervision of the AI system in the sandbox and provided guidance for compliance, no administrative fines shall be imposed regarding that law"

