        OTHERWISE JUST (`AI regulatory sandboxes are open to any applying provider or prospective provider of an AI system who fulfils eligibility and selection criteria` AND `the eligibility and selection criteria are transparent and fair` AND `national competent authorities inform applicants of their decision within three months of the application`)  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "that AI regulatory sandboxes are open to any applying provider or prospective provider of an AI system who fulfils eligibility and selection criteria, which shall be transparent and fair, and that national competent authorities inform applicants of their decision within three months of the application"

-- src:897 | (a) that AI regulatory sandboxes are open to any applying provider or prospective provider of an AI system who fulfils eligibility and selection criteria, which shall be transparent and fair, and that national competent authorities inform applicants of their decision within three months of the application;
@ref Art 58(2)(a) (the date by which the applicant is to be informed) (src:897)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the date of the application to participate in the AI regulatory sandbox` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Art 58(2)(a) the date by which the national competent authority is to inform the applicant of its decision` MEANS
    IF NOT (`Art 57 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`)
    THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): Chapter VI and Chapter VIII (group General) apply from the date Art 113 gives
    ELSE JUST (`add months` `the date of the application to participate in the AI regulatory sandbox` 3)  -- "within three months of the application": calendar months, the end of a shorter month clamped

-- src:897 | (a) that AI regulatory sandboxes are open to any applying provider or prospective provider of an AI system who fulfils eligibility and selection criteria, which shall be transparent and fair, and that national competent authorities inform applicants of their decision within three months of the application;
@ref Art 58(2)(a) (the duty of the national competent authority to inform the applicant within three months) (src:897)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the date of the application to participate in the AI regulatory sandbox` IS A DATE
      `the implementing acts adopted under Article 58(1) are in force` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Art 57 party` `Art 57 act`
`Art 58(2)(a) the national competent authority's duty to inform the applicant of its decision` MEANS
    IF NOT ((`Art 57 the group General applies on the date asked` `the date asked`) AND `the implementing acts adopted under Article 58(1) are in force`)
    THEN FULFILLED  -- nothing is owed: Chapter VI does not apply on the date asked, or the implementing acts the text refers to do not exist yet (they are outside the sources)
    ELSE
        PARTY `Art 57 national competent authority`
        MUST `Art 58(2)(a) inform the applicant of the decision on the application`
        WITHIN (Day (`add months` `the date of the application to participate in the AI regulatory sandbox` 3)) MINUS (Day `the date of the application to participate in the AI regulatory sandbox`)
        HENCE FULFILLED
        LEST BREACH BY `Art 57 national competent authority` BECAUSE "the applicant was not informed of the decision within three months of the application"

